                        "username": "chaul-ampere"
                    },
                    "message": "The 2 configs in the previous 2 commits have 2 tachometers on each fan and need to reuse the connector config of the same PWM channel. Because this machine only has one tach on each physical fan, so there's no need to define a separate Connector config but just define it directly here."
                },
